This project's agent rules live in docs/rules.md. Read docs/rules.md and docs/phase.md before every task.
Work only on the current phase listed in docs/phase.md.
Never invent library versions, Gradle coordinates or Android APIs; verify them first.
Never upload contacts, call logs or SMS bodies to any server.
Every change ships with tests and a green `./gradlew check`.
Update docs/phase.md at the end of every task.
